content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Couple",
      "description": "People getting married and making event decisions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wedding Vision Brief",
      "description": "Document outlining the couple’s style and budget",
      "attributes": [
        "Theme",
        "Budget"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Theme",
      "description": "Chosen visual or stylistic direction"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget",
      "description": "Expected spending range for the wedding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Event Schedule",
      "description": "Timeline of key moments on the wedding day",
      "attributes": [
        "Key Moment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Key Moment",
      "description": "Special planned part of the wedding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wedding Planner",
      "description": "Person coordinating wedding preparations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor Shortlist",
      "description": "List of suggested providers for the couple",
      "attributes": [
        "Venue Manager",
        "Florist",
        "Catering Manager"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor Booking",
      "description": "Confirmed reservation with a selected vendor"
    },
    {
      "name": "Venue Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for the wedding location"
    },
    {
      "name": "Venue Confirmation",
      "description": "Response confirming the venue is available"
    },
    {
      "name": "Florist",
      "description": "Vendor creating floral work for the wedding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floral Arrangement",
      "description": "Decorative flower pieces for the event"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bouquet Delivery",
      "description": "Transport of bouquets and flowers to the venue"
    },
    {
      "name": "Catering Manager",
      "description": "Person managing food service for the event"
    },
    {
      "name": "Menu Order",
      "description": "Final list of dishes and quantities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Meal Service",
      "description": "Execution of serving food during the event"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Catering": {
      "objects": [
        "Catering Manager",
        "Menu Order",
        "Meal Service"
      ]
    },
    "Venue Organization": {
      "objects": [
        "Vendor Booking",
        "Venue Manager",
        "Venue Confirmation"
      ]
    },
    "Floral Arrangement": {
      "objects": [
        "Vendor Booking",
        "Florist",
        "Floral Arrangement",
        "Bouquet Delivery"
      ]
    },
    "Planning": {
      "objects": [
        "Couple",
        "Wedding Planner",
        "Wedding Vision Brief",
        "Theme",
        "Budget",
        "Event Schedule",
        "Key Moment",
        "Vendor Shortlist",
        "Venue Manager",
        "Florist",
        "Catering Manager"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Catering": {
      "derived from": "Catering Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Catering Booking",
        "Menu Order",
        "Meal Service"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Catering Manager -> Catering Booking"
      ]
    },
    "Venue Organization": {
      "derived from": "Venue Organization Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Venue Booking",
        "Venue Manager",
        "Venue Confirmation"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Vendor Booking -> Venue Booking"
      ]
    },
    "Floral Arrangement": {
      "derived from": "Floral Arrangement Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Florist Booking",
        "Florist",
        "Floral Arrangement",
        "Bouquet Delivery"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Vendor Booking -> Florist Booking"
      ]
    },
    "Planning": {
      "derived from": "Planning Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Couple",
        "Wedding Planner",
        "Wedding Vision Brief",
        "Theme",
        "Budget",
        "Event Schedule",
        "Key Moment",
        "Vendor Shortlist",
        "Venue Listing",
        "Florist Listing",
        "Catering Listing"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Venue Manager -> Venue Listing",
        "Florist -> Florist Listing",
        "Catering Manager -> Catering Listing"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
